{"id":"wb-6-687","name":"陈芳家宅","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"陈芳家宅","text":"陈芳家宅是位于中国广东省珠海市香洲区凤山街道梅溪社区的古建筑群，始建于清朝光绪十七年（1891年），历经六年陆续建成。由清末华商陈芳建造。包括陈芳故居、陈氏宗祠、梅溪大庙、梅溪石牌坊3座、梅溪碉楼、“胜地佳城”碑刻、西洋墓地等。2006年，陈芳家宅被国务院列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%99%88%E8%8A%B3%E5%AE%B6%E5%AE%85","revisionId":94086464,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94086464","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/577f2313c0028a189ec7ee11.jpg","title":"20260114_Former_residence_of_Chun_Afong_(142937).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260114_Former_residence_of_Chun_Afong_(142937).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/20260114_Former_residence_of_Chun_Afong_%28142937%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yumeto","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Former residence of Chun Afong","width":320,"height":240}}